5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The current first-come-first-served model is inefficient. We need data to define the room's primary function.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. We are working close together yet remain strangers. We need a space for difficult talks.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I am worried about the hidden labor. Who cleans the crumbs? Who moves the bins?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We are bleeding money on a room that fails its core purpose. I need the invoices.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,The noise leaks into my workspace. I need to understand the physical source of the disturbance.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, your concern about cleanup is valid. We should track who uses the space and for how long.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, tracking usage helps, but we also need to know where awkward conversations currently happen.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I will look into the tally of use. I want to see who is actually here.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I will pull the invoices for outside hire. We need to see the real cost of this mess.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I will check the facilities callouts. The sound and mess are physical problems, not just social ones.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, cost is important, but usage patterns will tell us if the room is even needed.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, the physical environment matters, but the lack of privacy is the bigger issue.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"I will also look at the crumbs and bins. It’s a small thing, but it eats my time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will also check the quotes for the two fit-outs. We need to know the price of fixing it.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will also look at the partition wall. It is the barrier between us and the chaos.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Let’s gather these facts. We cannot decide based on feelings alone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. Facts will help us find a place where we can actually speak.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I just want to stop doing the work that isn’t mine. Let’s see the numbers.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,The numbers will show us we are overpaying for underperformance. Let’s see the data.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,The data will show us where the peace is breaking down. Let’s look at the walls.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
