34,2,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The tally shows two people dominate the room. The unplanned talk has moved to the printer.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,I found the last awkward conversation happened in front of everyone. We have no private space.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,The crumbs are everywhere. I am spending twenty minutes a day cleaning up after others.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"We paid 68,000 yen for outside hire. The fit-out quotes are 141,000 and 96,000.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The wall is thin. I hear everything. The callouts show the equipment is the real noise source.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, those costs are high. But the usage data shows the room is underutilized by most.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, underutilized for work, but overutilized for silence. We need a place to talk.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, if we pay for a fit-out, who cleans it? I am not doing it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the 96,000 yen option includes a fridge. That solves the food waste issue.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, the fridge is a source of noise. The wall is the bigger problem.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"We have three options. A dedicated meeting room, a quiet zone, or a shared lounge.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The shared lounge is where we are now. It fails. We need a dedicated space for talk.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,The quiet zone saves my time. No one is there to clean up after.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"The dedicated meeting room costs 141,000. The quiet zone is cheaper. The lounge is free but broken.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,The quiet zone respects the wall. It stops the sound from leaking into my desk.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,Let’s vote. The data supports a structured approach. We need to pick one.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for the space that allows us to be human. The dedicated room.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I vote for the quiet zone. It stops the labor. It stops the crumbs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I vote for the dedicated room. It is the only one that justifies the cost.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,I vote for the quiet zone. It protects the peace. It respects the thin wall.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
