60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option C removes the ambiguity. A shared calendar means no one is left to guess who is using the room.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Option C gives us a place to say the hard things. It turns the room into a tool for connection.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"Option B is the only one that doesn’t add to my workload. No one is cooking, no one is cleaning.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option C is the only one that justifies the 141,000 yen. It creates a professional asset.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option B is the only one that respects the wall. It stops the sound from reaching my desk.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@May, Option B is efficient, but it ignores the need for collaboration. We are a team.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Ryuji, I agree. We are strangers because we have no place to talk. Option C fixes that.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, I am not a team player if the team makes me clean up. Option B is my only choice.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the cost of Option C is high, but the cost of the status quo is higher.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Shunichi, the cost of noise is higher than the cost of a wall. Option B is the only peace.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,The data shows the room is used by two people. Option C makes that usage accountable.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,The data shows the awkward conversations happen in public. Option C makes them private.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,The data shows I am cleaning up after everyone. Option B stops that.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,The data shows we are paying for outside hire. Option C stops that.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,The data shows the wall is thin. Option B stops the sound.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am voting for Option C. It is the most rational choice.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am voting for Option C. It is the most human choice.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,I am voting for Option B. It is the only choice that respects my time.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I am voting for Option C. It is the only choice that respects the money.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,I am voting for Option B. It is the only choice that respects the peace.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
